<title>INDIA: Stocks which moved India's BSE Index - Feb 24.</title>
<headline>Stocks which moved India's BSE Index - Feb 24.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is an analysis of the 30-share Bombay Stock Exchange (BSE) index movement at the close of trade on Monday.</p>
<p>The table shows the stocks which moved the index most during the day and their percentage contribution to the net change.</p>
<p>The index at the close  was 3358.47,81.02 points or 2.36 percent lower than Friday's close.</p>
<p>.</p>
